{'symbol': 'V', 'date': '2021-08-30 06:00:00', 'title': 'CHASE AND VISA HELP SUPPORT NEW YORKERS WITH TAP TO RIDE', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CHASE (NYSE: JPM) AND VISA (NYSE: V) HAVE ANNOUNCED THAT STARTING TODAY AND THROUGH SEPTEMBER, WHEN RIDERS TAP ON MTA SUBWAYS OR BUSES WITH A CHASE VISA CONTACTLESS CARD, THEY WILL DONATE 10 CENTS PER TAP, UP TO $250,000, TO LOCAL NONPROFIT NEW YORK CARES.1 WHETHER A RESIDENT OR VISITOR TO NEW YORK CITY, TAPPING TO RIDE IS A QUICK, EASY AND SECURE WAY TO GET AROUND NEW YORK. NOW, RIDERS WHO TAP WITH THEIR CHASE VISA CONTACTLESS CARD CAN ALSO GIVE BACK TO LOCAL NONPROF'}